  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the end of three years from the date of this permission.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to comply with the provisions of Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The details of the (1) replacement windows to the Leather Lane street entrances, (2) new double-height door to the northern flank the Sweeps building, and (3) roof terrace railings to be used on the building shall be submitted to and approved by the Council before any work is commenced on the relevant part of the development. These parts of the development shall not be carried out otherwse than in accordance with the approved details. \r\n\r\nReason: To safeguard the appearance of the premises and the character of the immediate area in accordance with the requirements of policies EN1, EN13 and EN31 of the London Borough of Camden Unitary Development Plan 2000.\r\n"
