  "description": "Variation of planning permission Refs: PSX0105374 (Approved 09/03/04) and 2004/3708/P (Approved 22/12/04) for the mixed used conversion and refurbishment of the building. Various external alterations include (1) The repositioning of the bin/bicycle storage areas to an area adjacent to the flank wall of the building to the north (2) blocking in the two existing entrances with windows to match existing; (3) provision of new roof terrace at 34-38 Leather Lane and associated railings; (4) extension of the width of existing balconies at 2nd and 3rd floor level; (5) alterations to mezzanine at ground floor level.",
